================================================================================
 PITDB BENCHMARK 5/5
 Chunk-Granularity Trade-Off
================================================================================

Question
  How does chunk granularity affect pruning precision, chunk overhead, and
  query performance?

Configuration
  Rows                 : 5,010
  Symbols              : 10
  Granularities tested : Weekly, Monthly, Quarterly
  Queries              : 9: SYN000003, SYN000000, SYN000007 x 3 months, 1 month, 6 months, each with a median-close price band
  Warmup runs          : 3
  Measured runs        : 18

